1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Ratu Suniya Larang / Ratu di Subanglarang / Ratu Parung=
2 CONT (anak tunggal)
2 CONT
2 CONT Hanggarbeni marang Raden Ranggamantri putrana  Raden Pamanahrasa putuna Raden Mundingsari  Ageng, buyutna Menak Kancana trah Prabu Niskaladewa saking Karajaaan Pajajaran.
2 CONT
2 CONT Diistrenan jadi Narpati di Talaga nganggo gelar radja Pajajaran”Prabu Pucuk Umun” (1490 – 1550), dina  taun1529 Prabu Pucuk Umun di Islamkeun kuingkang uwa  Pangeran Cakrabuana Pangeran Walangsungsang sareng Sunan Gunung Jati sang
2 CONC  narpati katelah Sunan Pucuk Umum (Pangawasa Balarea Anyar).*** bhs Arab  al Umah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ratu Suniya Larang/Ratu Subanglarang saking Kraton Parung Champaga, Hanggarbeni  marang  RadenRanggamantri  putrane  Raden Pamanahrasa  puputra  nem:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Prabu Haurkoneng  kaping telu (Ratu Galuh Panyocok kuayana Galugu Citanduy karajaan kerem robih jadi Rawa Lakbok ), (1550-tug dugi 1560). Nalika anjeuna jadi Narpati di Talaga, karajaan Talaga jadi Vazal Kasultanan Demak kaereh 
2 CONC ku Dipati Carbon nurutkeun eusi babadamian Karaton Ciburang  (1557)
2 CONT # Ariya Kikis (Sunan Wanaperih).(1560 tug dugi ka  1565).
2 CONT # Ariya Tjutjuk /Dalem Lumaju Agung (Bupati Majaagung).
2 CONT # Pangeran Singalodra/Dalem Santoan Luar  Singandaru (Sunan Umbul Luar).
2 CONT # Dalem Panungtung /Santoan Patra Djenar.(Girilawungan).
2 CONT # Dalem Panaekan./Siriwati.
2 CONT
2 CONT Miturut ujar Ratu Sabda Radja  Kandjeng Sunan Ariya Kikis tumitah  dina gempungan Pasanggrahan Ageng Karadjaan Talaga (1561), yen sekabeh Dalem  ditetepkeun mandiri dina tatanan ngerbayaksa  ngolah nagara telatah  masing masing ka
2 CONC lebet urusan  bala-kapradjuritan.Kapindo tiap  taun dina bulan Syafar  Para Dalem dibarengan Lurah Pradjurit Utama kudu Caos hadir dina gempungan Ageng taunan.Ieu kawicaksanaan diterapkeun jang lengkah taki taki nyanghareupan gonj
2 CONC ang ganjingna  rebut kawasa antara Sultan Demak, Padjang lan Pamanahan anu mangaruhan katentreman rahayat.
2 CONT
2 CONT ======
2 CONT Note on 21 March 2014/em: Name in Yaya Suryana Diagram: Ratu Wulansari (Ratu Parung / Sunyalarang)
2 CONT Note on 5 November 2010/em:
2 CONT Link to her profile in Joyce Tree:
2 CONT http://www.geni.com/people/Sunyalarang-Ratu/6000000003010862281
2 CONT =============================================
2 CONT Note on 4 August 2010/em:
2 CONT Merge with profile in Vishnu path: Ratu Sunyalarang.
2 CONT =============================================
2 CONT Ratu Talaga abt 1500 - 1550.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT As the only daughter, she succeeded her father, Sunan Parung (King of Parung) and married with Prabu Siliwangi's descendant, Raden Rangga Mantri or otherwise known as Prabu Pucuk Unum. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Islam was gaining foothold and spreading fast. Her people became Moslems that the Queen and also her father in law (Prabu Pucuk Unum) also reportedly became Moslems.
2 CONT
2 CONT Islam spread and influenced her territory, including Maja, Rajagaluh and Majalengka. Prabu Pucuk Umum is the second Talaga King that converted to Islam. The relations between Talaga with Cirebok and Pajajaran Kingdoms were good. P
2 CONC rabu Pucuk Unum is the grandson of Prabu Siliwangi from Raden Munding Sari Ageng. So the marriage between Prabu Pucuk Umum and Ratu Sunyalarang is a family marriage in the 4th degree.   
2 CONT
2 CONT Most noted is that during her reign, Talaga became a trade hub of the South.
